  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T06:29:03.605225Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T02:53:13.169549Z",
  "totalBlocks": 110,
  "translatedBlocks": 107,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd00fabff1da0b8a",
      "translationZh": "我们通过一款名为 Hugging Face Skills 的新工具，赋予了 Claude 微调语言模型的能力。不仅能编写训练脚本，还能实际向云端 GPU 提交作业、监控进度，并将完成训练的模型推送到 Hugging Face Hub。本教程将介绍它的工作原理，以及你如何亲自使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a549e327cc0c623e",
      "translationZh": "Claude Code 可以使用“技能”——打包好的指令、脚本和领域知识——来完成专门任务。hf-llm-trainer 技能会教给 Claude 训练所需的全部知识：根据模型大小选择哪种 GPU、如何配置 Hub 身份验证、何时使用 LoRA 而不是全量微调，以及如何处理成功完成一次训练运行所涉及的其他数十项决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a1a67741ca2edb8",
      "translationZh": "有了这项技能，你就可以向 Claude 提出诸如此类的要求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3225b975fad2caa5",
      "translationZh": "而 Claude 将会：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad9c3e877ff07304",
      "translationZh": "验证你的数据集格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d68f1ac1a5f9d910",
      "translationZh": "选择合适的硬件（为 0.6B 模型选择 t4-small）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e0f0e4ff8124dd4",
      "translationZh": "使用并更新带有 Trackio 监控功能的训练脚本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ecc617711bd553a",
      "translationZh": "将作业提交到 Hugging Face Jobs",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c14ed1524113a127",
      "translationZh": "报告作业 ID 和预估费用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be803c1be1ac3a09",
      "translationZh": "在你提出要求时检查进度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a72d20bfd43a537",
      "translationZh": "如果出现问题，帮助你调试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20a0020b6c49c767",
      "translationZh": "模型会在 Hugging Face GPU 上训练，同时你可以做其他事情。训练完成后，你微调后的模型就会出现在 Hub 上，可直接使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5feef5b37c1d9d8d",
      "translationZh": "这可不是一个玩具演示。该技能支持生产环境中使用的同样的训练方法：监督微调、直接偏好优化，以及基于可验证奖励的强化学习。你可以训练参数量从 0.5B 到 70B 的模型，将其转换为 GGUF 以便在本地部署，还可以运行结合不同技术的多阶段流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bcd75e0f4b0b422a",
      "translationZh": "设置与安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39d86a90524d2488",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，你需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd40f96a0e6130ac",
      "translationZh": "一个订阅了 Pro 或 Team / Enterprise 套餐的 Hugging Face 账号（Jobs 需要付费套餐）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f70dd1d9bca842b",
      "translationZh": "一个从 huggingface.co/settings/tokens 获取的具有写入权限的令牌",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edad50178c5c437b",
      "translationZh": "一个编程智能体，例如 Claude Code、OpenAI Codex 或 Google 的 Gemini CLI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02096993939bc3d8",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 技能兼容 Claude Code、Codex 和 Gemini CLI。对 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Continue 的集成支持也即将推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ab2e57a68955925",
      "translationZh": "将该仓库注册为插件市场中的插件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46ff5c8e59d5bc63",
      "translationZh": "要安装一项技能，请运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652744a2ab28954b",
      "translationZh": "例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d8e14a7c1f6c963",
      "translationZh": "Codex 会通过 AGENTS.md 文件识别这些技能。你可以使用以下方式验证指令是否已加载：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df90a49e4a9f9d39",
      "translationZh": "更多详情，请参阅 Codex AGENTS 指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50ec4a4997ec5efb",
      "translationZh": "此仓库包含 gemini-extension.json，用于与 Gemini CLI 集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c88f69ddbcc7fe37",
      "translationZh": "在本地安装：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6f046951035d212",
      "translationZh": "或使用 GitHub URL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a76aa17520ea9bb",
      "translationZh": "如需更多帮助，请参阅 Gemini CLI 扩展文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "732cc9d1e4e86ea1",
      "translationZh": "连接到 Hugging Face",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e32be768cd7ffd8",
      "translationZh": "你必须使用具有写入权限的令牌登录验证你的 Hugging Face 账户，以便作业能够创建模型仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19ecc350b71befc5",
      "translationZh": "设置你的令牌：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "788d8ac53b74ab80",
      "translationZh": "配置 Hugging Face MCP Server，使其使用你的写入令牌：通过 HF_TOKEN 或 Authorization: Bearer HTTP 请求头发送该令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "411e220c262d2948",
      "translationZh": "对于 Claude Code：claude mcp add --transport http hf-skills https://huggingface.co/mcp?bouquet=skills --header \"Authorization: Bearer $HF_TOKEN\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "522cd8ff489c6e3e",
      "translationZh": "你的首次训练运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aebd8b6630d81b1b",
      "translationZh": "让我们看一个完整的示例。我们将微调一个小模型，了解整个工作流程，然后探索更高级的功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "143935b01687a547",
      "translationZh": "指示编程智能体进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d5d6b6079710580",
      "translationZh": "首先给出一条简单明确的指令，要求微调某个特定模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "149ffc160b373d73",
      "translationZh": "编码智能体会分析你的请求，并准备一份训练配置。对于在演示数据集上训练的 0.6B 模型，它会选择 t4-small——其 GPU 资源足以满足这一规模模型的需求，而且是可用选项中最便宜的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c246ee5dc01ccc97",
      "translationZh": "open-r1/codeforces-cots 数据集包含 codeforces 题目及解答。它是一个很适合用于指令微调的数据集，可以训练模型解决高难度编程问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38348665efb52997",
      "translationZh": "这也适用于视觉语言模型！你只需运行“在 llava-instruct-mix 上微调 Qwen/Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct”即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "868a01253f0688db",
      "translationZh": "提交前检查",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c65e979900587213",
      "translationZh": "在编码智能体提交任何内容之前，你会先看到配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "494278e59ae1d29f",
      "translationZh": "这是你调整各项设置的机会。你可以更改输出仓库名称、选择其他硬件，或让 Claude 修改训练参数。获得你的批准后，智能体就会提交作业。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fd19395d74307e5",
      "translationZh": "例如，你可以让智能体尝试一次测试运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f21ad02a67a5985d",
      "translationZh": "跟踪进度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16aad27e0fd757a2",
      "translationZh": "提交后，你会获得作业详情：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45fee597d2328c59",
      "translationZh": "该技能集成了 Trackio，因此你可以实时观察训练损失的下降。作业以异步方式运行，所以你可以关闭终端，稍后再回来查看。当你想了解最新进展时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "475f3f359a23044c",
      "translationZh": "随后，智能体会获取日志并总结进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "47572ca4384deeb7",
      "translationZh": "使用你的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fba44b0356c97d94",
      "translationZh": "训练完成后，你的模型就会出现在 Hub 上：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0d2b81e33f5c088",
      "translationZh": "这就是完整的流程。你用通俗的英语描述了自己的需求，而智能体负责处理 GPU 选择、脚本生成、作业提交、身份验证和持久化。整个过程花费约三十美分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b6866eb258ab32f7",
      "translationZh": "训练方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "750cd66f67001dd8",
      "translationZh": "该技能支持三种训练方式。了解每种方式的适用时机，有助于你获得更好的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "233ee67530717030",
      "translationZh": "监督微调（SFT）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86422ef3f3ff9322",
      "translationZh": "SFT 是大多数项目的起点。你提供示范数据，也就是输入及期望输出的示例，训练过程会调整模型，使其匹配这些模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0afd2f21f9726f3e",
      "translationZh": "当你拥有所需行为的高质量示例时，就可以使用 SFT。客户支持对话、代码生成配对数据、特定领域的问答——只要能向模型展示什么是好的表现，都可以使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ff894a898087313",
      "translationZh": "智能体会验证数据集、选择硬件（对于 7B 模型，使用 a10g-large 并结合 LoRA），并配置包含检查点和监控的训练流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91862f77686ecb01",
      "translationZh": "对于参数量超过 3B 的模型，智能体会自动使用 LoRA（低秩适配）来降低内存需求。这使得在单个 GPU 上训练 7B 或 13B 模型成为可能，同时保留全量微调的大部分效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c082bea55dc25f37",
      "translationZh": "直接偏好优化（DPO）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "903886b891b25fc6",
      "translationZh": "DPO 使用偏好对进行训练，即一个被“选中”、另一个被“拒绝”的成对回答。这能使模型输出与人类偏好对齐，通常在初始 SFT 阶段之后进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbddaf23dcc469e9",
      "translationZh": "当你拥有人类标注员提供的偏好标注或自动化比较结果时，就可以使用 DPO。DPO 直接针对更受偏好的回答进行优化，无需单独的奖励模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6d2ed0ff6c7c052",
      "translationZh": "DPO 对数据集格式很敏感。它要求有名称严格为 chosen 和 rejected 的列，或者一个包含输入内容的 prompt 列。智能体会先验证这一点，如果你的数据集使用不同的列名，它会向你展示如何映射这些列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d081d0909208f1c",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 Skills 在视觉语言模型上运行 DPO！试试 openbmb/RLAIF-V-Dataset 吧。Claude 会做一些小幅修改，但能够成功完成训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "48724757c54529b9",
      "translationZh": "组相对策略优化（GRPO）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86b5162d9c4780e3",
      "translationZh": "GRPO 是一种强化学习任务，已被证明对可验证的任务有效，例如解数学题、编写代码，或任何具有程序化成功判定标准的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a561ca962063c730",
      "translationZh": "模型生成回答，根据正确性获得奖励，并从结果中学习。这比 SFT 或 DPO 更复杂，但配置方式相似。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c324ccea1cc850a",
      "translationZh": "硬件与成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4b18a888dcd8a1e",
      "translationZh": "智能体会根据你的模型大小选择硬件，但了解其中的权衡有助于你做出更好的决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "922ef0f0d46c8144",
      "translationZh": "模型大小与 GPU 的对应关系",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f23ae02106b4f713",
      "translationZh": "对于参数量低于 1B 的微型模型，t4-small 效果很好。这些模型训练速度很快——完整训练一次预计花费 $1-2。这非常适合教学或实验性训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90dc99d43a4cbafc",
      "translationZh": "对于小型模型（1-3B），请升级到 t4-medium 或 a10g-small。训练需要几个小时，费用为 $5-15。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b047293f26b38829",
      "translationZh": "对于中型模型（3-7B），你需要使用 a10g-large 或 a100-large，并配合 LoRA。全量微调所需的显存装不下，但 LoRA 能让这些模型变得很容易训练。生产用途的预算为 $15-40。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c7189e6abfc5740",
      "translationZh": "对于大型模型（7B+），这项 HF skills 任务并不适用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d3fbf73832a288e",
      "translationZh": "演示与生产",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d88e0785cae7bd6e",
      "translationZh": "测试工作流时，先从小规模开始：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfda4f1723ea224e",
      "translationZh": "编程智能体会配置最小规模的训练——足以验证你的流水线能否正常运行，而不会产生实质性成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9ff69fb76cf6473",
      "translationZh": "用于生产时，请明确提出要求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35cfa9ca68d4c211",
      "translationZh": "在决定运行耗时数小时的正式作业之前，务必先运行一次演示。一次 $0.50 的演示如果能发现格式错误，就能避免一次耗费 $30 的失败运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "004c292f8ce1e3e0",
      "translationZh": "数据集验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d51a7410f2eccec2",
      "translationZh": "数据集格式是训练失败最常见的原因。智能体可以在你花费 GPU 时间之前验证数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c82142fdbbf392d1",
      "translationZh": "智能体会在 CPU 上进行快速检查（成本不到一美分），并报告：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e66efd13c2cc483",
      "translationZh": "如果你的数据集需要转换，智能体可以向你展示如何操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cb859247542d459",
      "translationZh": "智能体会提供映射代码，并且可以将其直接整合到你的训练脚本中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b353e12b937483e8",
      "translationZh": "监控训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92c9dce2b0cc5590",
      "translationZh": "实时监控有助于你及早发现问题。该技能默认会配置 Trackio——提交作业后，你可以在以下位置查看指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf9f1ea682a1df48",
      "translationZh": "这里会显示训练损失、学习率和验证指标。正常的训练运行中，损失会稳步下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd66802bc842de52",
      "translationZh": "随时向智能体询问状态：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92ca7ef59d2bf180",
      "translationZh": "如果出现问题，智能体会帮助诊断。内存不足？智能体会建议减小批次大小或升级硬件。数据集错误？智能体会找出不匹配之处。超时？智能体会建议延长运行时长，或采用更快的训练设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f86dbef7064df12c",
      "translationZh": "转换为 GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f0a65e8cea8f62c",
      "translationZh": "训练完成后，你可能希望在本地运行模型。GGUF 格式可用于 llama.cpp 以及依赖它的工具，例如 LM Studio、Ollama 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb0d8170239270db",
      "translationZh": "智能体会提交一个转换任务，合并 LoRA 适配器、转换为 GGUF、进行量化，并推送到 Hub。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc26ba852aa75058",
      "translationZh": "然后在本地使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf4040e2249bde",
      "translationZh": "下一步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "194c17c66ea7b29c",
      "translationZh": "我们已经展示，Claude Code、Codex 或 Gemini CLI 这样的编码智能体能够处理模型微调的完整生命周期：验证数据、选择硬件、生成脚本、提交作业、监控进度以及转换输出。这让原本需要专业技能才能完成的工作，变成了通过对话就能完成的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5eed33bcf2f39a9",
      "translationZh": "可以尝试以下几件事：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9aaf2dc118b4005",
      "translationZh": "使用你自己的数据集微调模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c80ebd0052e1c60b",
      "translationZh": "通过 SFT → DPO 构建符合偏好的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edd9828401313a33",
      "translationZh": "使用 GRPO，在数学或代码任务上训练推理模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56f23ba009d5d7e6",
      "translationZh": "将模型转换为 GGUF 格式，并使用 Ollama 运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08475af77200c5a3",
      "translationZh": "这项技能是开源的。你可以扩展它，根据自己的工作流程进行定制，或将其作为其他训练场景的起点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
